4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Hg2HK9g2kvQQ7kNvwGnFk-R&_nc_oc=Adr2uTrUI1cgn201wPimKdc4JK9dzrYMGg3GoZIEy4EH88nZ8IlMRo1nk3v6aSSNZO0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOxBsbI2YdkAFrADtxTH0n-AX6oMHCizLH6LUFn3V6i0A&oe=6ACBC194"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VGyj2a_aGUMQ7kNvwG5S6ON&_nc_oc=Adov8poe29wQOd3mLYNHsCPwua2h8wlAMshwtKkCdIu0G0iXINoI7u-JREgVUHREDZg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNNvLQHKLgvlGdS6LxoTW_jVznBryEYNw5a5eOkuMuotw&oe=6ACB8E32"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hedg6qKuEiEQ7kNvwGbS_rh&_nc_oc=AdoQ0mwh1w4970AZyzRR5SnDwxZIfNmTQMmHNec0qVcwuesD2puASUl8pUxFN64tk7A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOCWhn6FTKcphep6CtLheNLIcXN1RqKeb41vfoxU-cCcQ&oe=6ACB9BD5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p